If there is a patient-education and there is an outpatient-opioid-therapy then the patient-education is critical before the outpatient-opioid-therapy.
If there is a patient-discussion and there is an outpatient-opioid-therapy then the patient-discussion is critical before the outpatient-opioid-therapy.
A patient-preference can inform a clinical-decision.
A patient-value can inform a clinical-decision.
